<title>CANADA: Canada C$2.7 bln bond due 2000 yields 5.195 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada C$2.7 bln bond due 2000 yields 5.195 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government of Canada said its C$2.7 billion auction of 5.5 percent bonds due February 1, 2000 produced the following results:</p>
<p>			     YIELD	 PRICE</p>
<p>		   AVG     5.195     100.849  PCT AT</p>
<p>		   LOW     5.187     100.871  HI YIELD</p>
<p>		   HIGH    5.208     100.812   81.94118</p>
<p>Bids from primary dealers totalled C$6,125.85 million, including C$63.35 million non-competitive tenders at the average yield. The bonds will be dated and delivered on January 15. The outstanding issue totals C$5.5 billion.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
